+lSynoptic Edition+s-!
+lA simple example to expand for a synoptic edition of a text+s-!
+lAs it is quite difficult to propose a really generic template, we use two verses from Amenemhat (Helck, p. 92-92)+s-!
+bEND+s-!
+bTitle of the text+s-!
+idocument author+s-!
+lsource and bibliography+s-!
+loptional licence if you send it to the JSesh library:+s-!
+bLicence : Creative commons CC-BY+s-!
!
+iexamples taken from W. Helck, Der Text der Lehre Amenemhets I. für seinen Sohn, p. 91-92+s-!
+ito use this template, we would suggest to use View/Show Zone limits and View/Show tabs+s-!
!
